# Getting started

Menzies builds calm software for clinics, hospitals, studios, and busy front desks. Pick a product below to read its documentation, or open an app to see what it does.

<DocsAppCards />

## How to read these docs

Each product has its own section in the sidebar. Open a product, then open the area you work in, such as Billing or Registration, to find the screen you need.

Press **Ctrl+K** anywhere on this site to search every page.
